    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS CUSTODES VEHICLE** units improve as they lose models:\n\n- At Starting Strength: their models get +2 Objective Control, unless the unit is **AIRCRAFT** or Battle-shocked.\n- Below Starting Strength: for their models' attacks, Hit rolls of 1 may be re-rolled.\n- Below Half-strength: for their models' attacks, Hit rolls of 1 may be re-rolled, and so may Wound rolls of 1.",
